      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] \nSince `zephyr,system-timer \u003d \u0026lptim1;` is set unconditionally in `dartmonkey.dts`, `lptim1` is always the system timer for Dartmonkey builds, regardless of whether `CONFIG_PM` is enabled. Checking `CONFIG_PM` here conflates power management with the choice of timer. \n\nIf a build disables `CONFIG_PM` (e.g., a test build), this code will incorrectly fall back to `sys_clock_disable()`, which targets SysTick rather than `lptim1`. Please remove the `#if defined(CONFIG_PM)` conditional and reset `lptim1` unconditionally.\n[🔗](http://go/tj/4c4ae63b-7a8d-45b8-b1c8-d6e8c5b63069)",
